153
00:11:44,186 --> 00:11:47,001
nothing listens on the host's port 80.

154
00:11:47,001 --> 00:11:51,225
Check what is published, and what the image only exposes:

155
00:11:52,967 --> 00:11:56,374
Publish the port when the container is started.

156
00:11:56,374 --> 00:11:59,636
